<title>USA: Caraustar forms paperboard tube venture.</title>
<headline>Caraustar forms paperboard tube venture.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caraustar Industries Inc said Thursday it formed a joint venture company to make and market paperboard tubes and cores.</p>
<p>The new company will be named Star Paper Tube Northwest and will be located at a facility in Tacoma, Wash., which is owned by its partner, Paccess.</p>
<p>Paccess is a partnership that is part-owned by Koplick Co, a privately-held company.</p>
